---
/**
 * InteractionTypesDiagram.astro — V4
 *
 * Deep-dive visualization for the Interface dimension of the
 * Four Dimensions of AI in Services framework (ai-lx case).
 *
 * Three modes, side-by-side: explicit (bounded UI), ambient (presence-based),
 * mix (overlap of the two). The visual logic mirrors the prose:
 *   - explicit has a clear interface boundary (solid chat-bubble glyph)
 *   - ambient has no clear boundary (concentric radiating arcs)
 *   - mix is the Venn-style overlap, drawn with the same two motifs
 *
 * Sibling of InteractionModelComparison.astro — same eyebrow + tagline
 * register, same cream/gold/charcoal palette, same editorial restraint.
 * Three-card row collapses to a vertical stack on mobile.
 */
---

<figure class="v4-itd" aria-label="The three interface modes: explicit, ambient, and mix">
  <ol class="v4-itd-row">
    <li class="v4-itd-card">
      <header class="v4-itd-head">
        <span class="v4-itd-eyebrow">01 · Explicit</span>
        <h3 class="v4-itd-name">Explicit</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="v4-itd-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="64" height="64" role="img" focusable="false">
          <rect x="6" y="10" width="52" height="34" rx="4" ry="4"
                fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" />
          <path d="M18 44 L18 54 L30 44 Z"
                fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <line x1="14" y1="22" x2="50" y2="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <line x1="14" y1="30" x2="42" y2="30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="v4-itd-desc">
        The user knows they are interacting with AI. A bounded interface — something
        to open, type into, click.
      </p>

      <p class="v4-itd-example">
        <span class="v4-itd-example-label">For instance</span>
        a chatbot, a generative-AI panel inside a dashboard, a "summarize this" button.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="v4-itd-card">
      <header class="v4-itd-head">
        <span class="v4-itd-eyebrow">02 · Ambient</span>
        <h3 class="v4-itd-name">Ambient</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="v4-itd-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="64" height="64" role="img" focusable="false">
          <circle cx="32" cy="34" r="4" fill="currentColor" />
          <circle cx="32" cy="34" r="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 3" />
          <circle cx="32" cy="34" r="19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.7" />
          <circle cx="32" cy="34" r="27" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 5" opacity="0.45" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="v4-itd-desc">
        Presence-based. The system reacts without an explicit prompt; the interface
        dissolves into the environment.
      </p>

      <p class="v4-itd-example">
        <span class="v4-itd-example-label">For instance</span>
        the lot reads your license plate; the door greets you by name.
      </p>
    </li>

    <li class="v4-itd-card v4-itd-card-mix">
      <header class="v4-itd-head">
        <span class="v4-itd-eyebrow">03 · Mix</span>
        <h3 class="v4-itd-name">Mix</h3>
      </header>

      <div class="v4-itd-glyph" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" width="64" height="64" role="img" focusable="false">
          <!-- explicit: a small bounded panel on the left -->
          <rect x="6" y="20" width="30" height="22" rx="3" ry="3"
                fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <line x1="12" y1="28" x2="30" y2="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <line x1="12" y1="34" x2="26" y2="34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <!-- ambient: dotted rings overlapping it on the right -->
          <circle cx="44" cy="32" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 3" />
          <circle cx="44" cy="32" r="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 4" opacity="0.7" />
          <circle cx="44" cy="32" r="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"
                  stroke-dasharray="2 5" opacity="0.45" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <p class="v4-itd-desc">
        A bounded interface inside an ambient field — or an ambient signal that
        invites the user into an explicit moment.
      </p>

      <p class="v4-itd-example">
        <span class="v4-itd-example-label">For instance</span>
        the door greets you by name, then offers a tablet to confirm the appointment
        it already pulled up.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <figcaption class="v4-itd-footer">
    Most teams default to <em>explicit</em> because chatbots are the available metaphor.
    Ambient and mix are where service design has the most to say.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .v4-itd {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .v4-itd-row {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .v4-itd-card {
    background: var(--cream, #F4EDE4);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold, #C8943E);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.4rem 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Mix card gets a subtle dashed accent — visually argues "the overlap" */
  .v4-itd-card-mix {
    border-left-style: dashed;
  }

  .v4-itd-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .v4-itd-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, 'DM Mono', monospace);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-text, #8A6820);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .v4-itd-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Petrona', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--charcoal, #2A2520);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .v4-itd-glyph {
    color: var(--gold-text, #8A6820);
    line-height: 0;
    margin: 4px 0 2px;
  }
  .v4-itd-glyph svg {
    display: block;
  }

  .v4-itd-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Petrona', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--charcoal, #2A2520);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .v4-itd-example {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'DM Sans', sans-serif);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--charcoal-mid, #4A443D);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--cream-deep, #EBE1D4);
    max-width: none;
  }
  .v4-itd-example-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono, 'DM Mono', monospace);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--charcoal-soft, #6B6560);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .v4-itd-footer {
    font-family: var(--font-display, 'Petrona', Georgia, serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--charcoal-mid, #4A443D);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .v4-itd-footer em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold-text, #8A6820);
  }

  /* ============ Mobile ============ */
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .v4-itd-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .v4-itd-card {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.4rem;
    }
    .v4-itd-name {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
